2026-11-07T11:51:12.6320677Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-11-07T11:51:12.6321557Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-07T11:51:12.6322117Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-07T11:51:12.6322461Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-07T11:51:12.6322871Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-07T11:51:12.6323380Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-07T11:51:12.6323813Z    /root
2026-11-07T11:51:12.6334536Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-07T11:51:12.6335340Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-07T11:51:12.6346101Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-11-07T11:51:12.6346890Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-11-07T11:51:12.6347175Z 
2026-11-07T11:51:12.6348039Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
2026-11-07T11:51:12.6367959Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
